{"id":"656932","name":"糯米蒸排骨","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/656932/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"糯米","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜头","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨斩块后清水泡发出血水洗净备用。","img":"images/656932/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎。","img":"images/656932/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"糯米清水泡发2小时左右。","img":"images/656932/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"排骨加入适量玉米淀粉。","img":"images/656932/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入蚝油，生抽，老抽。","img":"images/656932/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入蒜末抓拌均匀。","img":"images/656932/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"适量花生油拌匀腌制1小时入味。","img":"images/656932/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"排骨均匀裹上糯米。","img":"images/656932/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将排骨糯米冷水上锅。","img":"images/656932/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大火煮开转中火蒸40分钟左右。","img":"images/656932/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"出锅前洒上葱花即可。","img":"images/656932/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656932/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656932/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656932/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}